-- A call script for examples/contract.lang (kit slice K3b).
-- Each call is NOW CALLER NAME ARGS. This script has an ok call, a revert,
-- a trap, a view and an emit.
100 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb deposit 5u
101 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb withdraw 9u

-- held is 5u, so this deposit overflows u256Add: a trap, as a revert.
102 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb deposit 0xffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffu
103 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb withdraw 2u
104 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb balance
105 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb stamp
